reviews.text:
Pros: floor-plan was great. Looked exactly like pictures. Beds were comfortable. We had everything we needed!

Grows: Traffic noise at all hours, Limited parking, Strong odor in the home. I recommend verifying that host has identified and eliminated the source of the smell prior to booking; 

Note: Do not over look the fact that they require all guests to send picture of their ID before they send your checkin details.
